# Exclusions for a build whose context is the REPOSITORY ROOT.
#
# No build in this repository uses that context today. The image is built from
# tasks/**/environment/, and Docker reads `<context>/.dockerignore`, so the rules that
# actually shape the image live in tasks/**/environment/.dockerignore. This file is kept so
# that an ad-hoc `docker build .` from the root does not upload 800 MB of corpus and
# checkpoints, and it is the wrong place to add rules meant for the environment image.

.git
.github
.vscode
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.venv
**/venv
**/outputs
**/outputs_*
**/cache
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.npz
logs
jobs
